WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Alright,

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:10.100
a word analogy!

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.600
Open is to closed,

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.133
as win is to...

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:15.733
what?

00:00:15.733 --> 00:00:16.367
A.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:17.000
Lose,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.633
B.

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:18.267
Quiet,

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:18.867
C.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:19.500
Cold,

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.767
or D.

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:21.400
Far?

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.633
Five seconds!

00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:29.633
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:30.833
It's...

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.333
A,

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:31.867
lose!

00:00:31.867 --> 00:00:34.433
Open and closed are opposites,

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:38.067
so the opposite of win is lose.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:39.767
Okay,

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:41.433
a picture puzzle!

00:00:41.433 --> 00:00:44.767
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:45.333
A.

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:45.867
Center,

00:00:45.867 --> 00:00:46.433
B.

00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:47.000
Top-right,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.533
C.

00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:48.100
Bottom-left,

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.200
or D.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:49.767
Right?

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:50.867
Five seconds!

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:57.867
TIME'S UP!

00:00:58.533 --> 00:00:59.867
The answer is...

00:00:59.867 --> 00:01:00.333
B,

00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:00.767
top-right!

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:03.467
The dot moves three spots clockwise

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:05.700
around the grid each step,

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.367
so the next spot is top-right.

00:01:09.533 --> 00:01:10.200
Alright,

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.200
a number analogy!

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.167
Two makes ten,

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:16.167
three makes fourteen,

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.167
five makes twenty-two,

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:20.133
so nine makes...

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:20.800
what?

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:21.467
A.

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:22.133
Thirty-four,

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:22.800
B.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:23.467
Forty-one,

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:24.100
C.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:24.767
Thirty-six,

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:26.100
or D.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:26.767
Thirty-eight?

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:28.100
Five seconds!

00:01:33.867 --> 00:01:35.067
TIME'S UP!

00:01:35.733 --> 00:01:36.300
It's...

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:36.900
D,

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:37.467
thirty-eight!

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:40.967
Each number is multiplied by four

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:42.700
then add two,

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:45.000
so nine becomes thirty-eight.

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:46.567
So,

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:48.600
are you smart or fart?

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.033
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:52.233
find your rank!

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:53.733
So,

00:01:53.733 --> 00:01:55.133
how did you do?

00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:56.500
Comment your score below,

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.867
and follow for more!
